### =====================================================================
### Kraków bez barier — remote MCP (F41) e2e: raw JSON-RPC over Streamable HTTP (VS Code REST Client)
###
### 1. Backend:  uv run python main.py                                              (http://localhost:8000)
### 2. MCP:      MCP_TRANSPORT=http PORT=8080 uv run --extra mcp python -m clients.mcp_server
###    or Render: set @mcp to https://<your-mcp-service>.onrender.com/mcp
### 3. Send top → bottom. Responses are JSON-RPC (may arrive as text/event-stream "data:" lines).
### MCP_AUTH_TOKEN set on the server? → uncomment the Authorization lines.
### =====================================================================

@mcp = http://localhost:8080/mcp
@health = http://localhost:8080/health
# @token = change-me

### M0. Health (always open, used by Render)
GET {{health}}

### M1. initialize → serverInfo.name "Kraków bez barier"
POST {{mcp}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {}, "clientInfo": {"name": "rest-client", "version": "1"}}}

### M2. tools/list → check_accessibility, search_accessible_places
POST {{mcp}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {}}

### M3. tools/call check_accessibility — MNK for a wheelchair → answer "yes"
POST {{mcp}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "check_accessibility", "arguments": {"place_name": "Muzeum Narodowe", "profile": "wheelchair"}}}

### M4. tools/call search_accessible_places — step-free entrance → MNK, ICE
POST {{mcp}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "search_accessible_places", "arguments": {"features": ["step_free_entrance"]}}}

### M5. Unknown place → "Nie znaleziono" (tool answers, no error)
POST {{mcp}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "check_accessibility", "arguments": {"place_name": "Smocza Jama"}}}
